# One window whose probe is inside its interval and one whose is not, on
# DISTINCT keys so both stay live.
#
# 15 is in [10,20) and fires. 45 is not in [30,40) and does not. Three facts
# at the end: two Windows and the one Hit.
assert Window start_t=10 end_t=20 probe=15
assert Window start_t=30 end_t=40 probe=45
pump
